     An improvement of the resolution of the identity approximation for the formation of the Coulomb matrix
     J. Comp. Chem. 2003 24(14), 1740-1747
     doi.org/10.1002/jcc.10318
  3. Neese, F.; Wennmohs, F.; Hansen, A.; Becker, U.
     Efficient, approximate and parallel Hartree-Fock and hybrid DFT calculations. A 'chain-of-spheres' algorithm for the Hartree-Fock exchange
     Chem. Phys. 2009 356(1-3), 98-109
     doi.org/10.1016/j.chemphys.2008.10.036
  4. Petrenko, T.; Kossmann, S.; Neese, F.
     Efficient time-dependent density functional theory approximations for hybrid density functionals: Analytical gradients and parallelization
     J. Chem. Phys. 2011 134 , 054116
     doi.org/10.1063/1.3533441
